# Optional SAM2 segmentation backend
# Platform-scoped due to build-time torch requirements.
# Run `make compile` in this directory to generate pinned ml-sam2.txt
#
# WARNING:
# - SAM2 has build-time torch requirements and may require non-default install
#   semantics on some platforms.
# - First, try installing via the lockfile: pip install -r requirements/ml-sam2.txt
# - If that fails, the bootstrap script will automatically retry with:
#   pip install --no-build-isolation sam2==1.1.0
# - This layer requires ml-core.in dependencies to be installed first.
#
# Capability contract:
# - This is an OPTIONAL layer. Absence downgrades segmentation to EfficientSAM.
# - Install via: make install-ml-sam2 or pip install -r requirements/ml-sam2.txt
#
# Licensing:
# - Meta Segment Anything 2 - check license for commercial use requirements.

# SAM2 - Meta Segment Anything 2 for advanced segmentation
# Pinned with torch==2.10.0/open-clip==3.3.0 for deterministic SAM2 masks
sam2==1.1.0                  # Deterministic builds: SAM2/CLIP stack compatibility
